  "help": {
    "documentTitle": "帮助 - BizTrack",
    "title": "BizTrack 快速指南",
    "Help - BizTrack": "帮助 - BizTrack",
    "Using BizTrack: A Quick Guide": "BizTrack 快速指南",
    "What is BizTrack?": "什么是 BizTrack？",
    "BizTrack is your go-to business management tool designed with small business owners in mind. It's an all-in-one platform that helps you effortlessly manage your products, track orders, and stay on top of your finances. Let me walk you through the basics:": "BizTrack 是为小型企业主设计的业务管理工具。它是一个一站式平台，帮助你管理产品、追踪订单，并掌握财务状况。以下是基本用法：",
    "Navigating the Dashboard": "浏览仪表盘",
    "The Dashboard is your central hub, giving you a snapshot of your business's overall performance. Here, you'll find key metrics like total expenses, revenues, profits and the number of orders. It's your command center for a quick overview.": "仪表盘是你的核心视图，会显示业务整体表现，包括总支出、收入、利润和订单数量等关键指标，方便你快速掌握状况。",
    "Expenses Page": "支出页面",
    "Record Your Expenses:": "记录支出：",
    "Head to the Expenses page to add your business expenses. Fill in the date, choose a category, enter the amount, and jot down any notes. It's that simple.": "前往支出页面添加业务支出，填写日期、选择分类、输入金额并加入备注即可。",
    "Edit or Delete Expenses:": "编辑或删除支出：",
    "Edit or Delete Expenses: Made a mistake? No worries! You can easily edit or delete expense records right from the Expenses page.": "填错了也不用担心，你可以直接在支出页面编辑或删除支出记录。",
    "Orders Page": "订单页面",
    "Track Your Orders:": "追踪订单：",
    "On the Orders page, you can keep tabs on all your orders. Each entry details the product, quantity, and order status.": "在订单页面，你可以查看所有订单。每条记录都包含产品、数量和订单状态。",
    "Effortless Editing:": "轻松编辑：",
    "effortlessEditingBody": "需要更新订单状态时，点击“编辑”按钮即可修改。",
    "Need to update an order status? Click the \"Edit\" button and make your changes. It's hassle-free.": "需要更新订单状态时，点击“编辑”按钮即可修改。",
    "Adding a New Expense, Order or Product": "添加支出、订单或产品",
    "addStepOpen": "点击“添加支出”，或在订单和产品页面点击相应的添加按钮。",
    "Click on \"Add Expense\" or the equivalent button on the order or product page.": "点击“添加支出”，或在订单和产品页面点击相应的添加按钮。",
    "Fill in the product details or order details or transaction date, category, amount, and any notes.": "填写产品资料、订单资料，或交易日期、分类、金额和备注。",
    "addStepDone": "提交后，订单、产品或交易会显示在相应页面和仪表盘上。",
    "Hit \"Done,\" and you're all set. Your order, product or transaction will now appear in the respective page and on the Dashboard.": "提交后，订单、产品或交易会显示在相应页面和仪表盘上。",
    "Sorting and Searching Entries/Tables": "排序和搜索记录",
    "Click on any column heading (headers) to sort the entries in the table by that column in either ascending order or alphabetical order.": "点击表格栏位标题，可以按该栏位以升序或字母顺序排序。",
    "You can also search for a particular product, order or expense by entering the value in the search box at the top of the respective page.": "你也可以在相应页面顶部的搜索框输入内容，搜索特定产品、订单或支出。",
    "Export to CSV": "导出 CSV",
    "exportBackupBody": "想备份或在其他工具分析资料时，只需点击“导出 CSV”即可下载包含业务资料的 CSV 文件。",
    "Want to keep a backup or analyze your data elsewhere? Simply click on \"Export to CSV\" to download a CSV file with all your business data.": "想备份或在其他工具分析资料时，只需点击“导出 CSV”即可下载包含业务资料的 CSV 文件。",
    "BizTrack is designed to be intuitive, user-friendly, and adaptable to your business needs. Explore the different pages, try out the features, and let BizTrack simplify your small business management.": "BizTrack 的设计重点是直观、易用并适配你的业务需要。你可以探索不同页面和功能，让 BizTrack 简化小型企业管理。",
    "Have questions, feedback, or just want to connect? Feel free to reach out!": "有问题、反馈，或想联系我？欢迎随时联系。"
  },
  "about": {
    "documentTitle": "关于 - BizTrack",
    "title": "我的编程旅程",
    "introHeading": "你好，我是 Sumayyah！",
    "About - Biztrack": "关于 - BizTrack",
    "My Coding Journey": "我的编程旅程",
    "Welcome to my little corner of the internet, where I'm rolling up my sleeves and diving into the coding world. I’m not your typical tech guru – I’m just a small business owner navigating the hustle and bustle of entrepreneurship. Oh, and did I mention I’m also part of the": "欢迎来到我的网上角落。在这里，我正一步步投入编程世界。我不是典型的科技专家，只是一位正在经营小生意、努力面对创业日常的人。对了，我也是",
    "program? Yeah, it's been quite the journey, and I owe a huge shoutout to my coding coach, Sam.": "课程的一员。这段旅程收获很多，也非常感谢我的编程导师 Sam。",
    "Let me spill the tea on BizTrack, my brainchild. So, picture this: I'm running a small business, trying to keep tabs on products, orders, and the never-ending finances - It’s a lot. That's when the light bulb moment happened, and BizTrack was born. It's not just a project; it's my answer to the chaos that comes with managing a business.": "说说 BizTrack 这个想法吧。经营小生意时，我需要同时管理产品、订单和各种财务资料，事情很快就会变得繁杂。因此我产生了建立 BizTrack 的想法。它不只是一个项目，而是我对业务管理混乱状态的一个实际回应。",
    "BizTrack is my attempt at making life a bit more straightforward for small business owners like me. You know, the ones who are constantly multitasking and could use a break. It's a manifestation of my passion for leveraging technology to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of business operations. It's not polished; it's not perfect, it's just a real solution for real-world challenges.": "BizTrack 是我尝试为小型企业主简化日常工作的一步。它来自我对技术的兴趣，也希望通过技术提升业务运作效率。它不完美，但它是面向真实问题的实用解决方案。",
    "I'm a student at GetCoding NL, a software development program that's turning me from someone who googles how websites work into someone who actually understands and builds them. And guess what? BizTrack is my first module project, allowing me to practically apply the skills and knowledge gained in the program. Learning by doing, they say, and that’s exactly what I'm doing.": "我是 GetCoding NL 的学生。这个软件开发课程正在把我从只会搜索“网站如何运作”的人，变成真正理解并能构建网站的人。BizTrack 是我的第一个模块项目，让我能把课程学到的知识用到实际作品中。",
    "But none of this would be possible without the guidance of my amazing coach,": "如果没有我出色导师的指导，这些都不会成真：",
    "Sam has been the compass in my coding journey. Patient, encouraging, and always ready with a helpful tip – he has made navigating the coding seas a whole lot less daunting.": "Sam 一直是我编程旅程中的重要指引。他耐心、鼓励我，并总能提供实用建议，让学习过程变得不那么令人畏惧。",
    "So, why spill all this in an about me section? Well, I’m not just sharing my story; I’m inviting you to join me on my journey. Whether you're into the chaos of small business life, curious about coding escapades, or just want to see where the two collide – you're welcome here.": "为什么要在关于页面分享这些？因为我不只是分享故事，也希望邀请你一起见证这段旅程。无论你关注小生意的日常、对编程好奇，或想看看两者如何结合，都欢迎你来到这里。",
    "Here's to coding, chaos, everything in between and heartfelt thanks to Sam!": "敬编程、敬忙碌日常，也真心感谢 Sam！"
  },
  "privacy": {
    "documentTitle": "隐私政策 - BizTrack",
    "title": "隐私政策",
    "heading": "我们重视你的隐私",
    "Privacy Policy - BizTrack": "隐私政策 - BizTrack",
    "BizTrack is a client-side small-business dashboard. Products, orders, expenses, language preference, and cookie consent are stored in this browser through localStorage.": "BizTrack 是一个客户端小型业务仪表盘。产品、订单、支出、语言偏好和 Cookie 同意状态都会通过 localStorage 储存在此浏览器。",
    "No account system, analytics tracker, advertising cookie, or server-side personal-data collection is used by this version of the application.": "此版本没有账户系统、分析追踪器、广告 Cookie 或服务器端个人资料收集。",
    "You can remove stored records at any time by clearing this site's browser data. Exported CSV files are created locally and are controlled by the user after download.": "你可以随时清除此网站的浏览器资料来移除已储存记录。导出的 CSV 文件在本机生成，下载后由用户自行管理。"
  },
